### Nested git repositories ###
# Shop-assist is its own repository. Committing it here would store only a
# gitlink - a bare commit id with no way to fetch it - so clones of this repo
# would get an empty directory. If it is meant to be part of this project it
# should be a plain directory (delete its .git), and if it is meant to be
# separate it belongs outside this tree.
Shop-assist/
